---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="about">
  <h2>about</h2>
  <p>
    This catalog collects AI skills and settings in one searchable
    place, so useful agent knowledge doesn't stay buried in chat logs.
  </p>
  <p>
    It is community-run: entries are written by readers, reviewed by
    volunteers, and free to use.
  </p>
  <p>
    Questions or problems? <a href="/help">Read how it works</a> or
    open an issue on the repo.
  </p>
</Base>
